<title>BELGIUM: Generale Bank cuts UM to &quot;hold&quot;.</title>
<headline>Generale Bank cuts UM to &quot;hold&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of research report -</p>
<p>Co name-----------Sector------Price------Broker-------------</p>
<p>Union Miniere     Metals	3,535 *    Generale Bank</p>
<p>COMMENT: Following share's 4.9 percent rise on Tuesday we reduce our buy rating issued March 24 when the share was at 2,630 francs. Since then the dollar has risen three percent, zinc prioces 10 percent and UM's share 34 percent. The expected 1998 price/cash flow ratio of above nine looks demanding for cyclical share, very sensitive to external and volatile factors.</p>
<p>A hold is justified because of further results potential from 1999. Date of recommendation: 01/07/97</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
